      "id": "c0cf5248-97c0-4cc0-bad9-6b69e48e19f7",
      "addedAt": "2026-09-02T22:25:35.146Z",
      "description": "\u201cFive adjacent sync and read-model defects were recorded while investigating the outbox ordering bug, including re-evaluation writes that ne\u2026\u201d contradicts \u201cEvery reactor judges every operation at its position in the merged order, so a revocation that sorts earlier retracts an already-accepted o\u2026\u201d. Opened automatically from a CONTRADICTS link \u2014 resolve if one side is right, dissolve if both hold in different contexts.",
      "involvedRefs": [
        "3968416f-1124-47ff-b195-1b782b5296ca",
        "0ade289f-d4fb-44d8-ab3b-316d65bb1c8d"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "96c0eec8-b22c-4300-82b5-0371eed1dfd2",
      "addedAt": "2026-09-03T07:21:10.676Z",
      "description": "\u201cA failed job silently drops its operations from the sync batch: handleJobFailed deletes the pending batch and emits whatever arrived, with \u2026\u201d contradicts \u201cGraphQL sync is four flows across two channel roles: the requesting channel pushes and polls, the responding channel serves from its outbox\u2026\u201d. Opened automatically from a CONTRADICTS link \u2014 resolve if one side is right, dissolve if both hold in different contexts.",
      "involvedRefs": [
        "bb823a22-5304-40dd-b087-5ae6a35e9755",
        "9c453091-8c7b-4210-af2f-600fead66af7"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "0498b011-747b-47bd-9f61-b9bccbb7645b",
      "addedAt": "2026-09-03T07:30:13.380Z",
      "description": "\u201cLazy sync would create one forced channel per opened document, because the forward-only cursor forbids widening a live channel's filter\u201d contradicts \u201cDrive apps read drive-wide data with useDocumentsInSelectedDrive() and start creation with showCreateDocumentModal()\u201d. Opened automatically from a CONTRADICTS link \u2014 resolve if one side is right, dissolve if both hold in different contexts.",
      "involvedRefs": [
        "fe8f33f5-b69c-4080-878a-1cd2cbe6bb17",
        "af8252cd-271d-41ea-b99d-9fe2a7123cea"
      ]
    }
  ],
